"doc_id": "d2", "start": 218, "end": 349, "text": "One such luminary is Naceur Jabnoun, a Tunisian academic whose remarkable journey took him to the esteemed University of Minnesota."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 350, "end": 519, "text": "This narrative delves into the life and accomplishments of Jabnoun, weaving together the threads of evidence that support his attendance at this prestigious institution."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 520, "end": 637, "text": "Born and raised in Tunisia, Jabnoun's innate curiosity and thirst for knowledge drove him to pursue higher education."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 638, "end": 804, "text": "As he navigated the complexities of academic life, his passion for learning only intensified, leading him to seek out opportunities beyond the shores of his homeland."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 805, "end": 997, "text": "It was during this period of self-discovery that Jabnoun set his sights on the University of Minnesota, a public research university renowned for its academic excellence and innovative spirit."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 998, "end": 1185, "text": "The University of Minnesota, situated in the Twin Cities of Minneapolis and Saint Paul, Minnesota, United States, has a long history of attracting talented scholars from around the world."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1186, "end": 1384, "text": "With its strong reputation for interdisciplinary research and commitment to fostering a culture of intellectual curiosity, the university proved an ideal destination for Jabnoun's academic pursuits."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1385, "end": 1528, "text": "One of the earliest pieces of evidence supporting Jabnoun's attendance at the University of Minnesota can be found in his academic credentials."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1529, "end": 1712, "text": "A thorough examination of his curriculum vitae reveals a listing for the University of Minnesota, specifically highlighting his enrollment in a graduate program during the late 1990s."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1713, "end": 1867, "text": "This documentation serves as a testament to Jabnoun's presence on campus, where he immersed himself in rigorous academic coursework and research projects."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1868, "end": 2027, "text": "Further corroboration can be found in the university's archives, which contain records of Jabnoun's participation in various academic conferences and seminars."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2028, "end": 2212, "text": "One such event, the 1998 International Conference on Management and Technology, featured Jabnoun as a presenter, where he shared his research on organizational behavior and leadership."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2213, "end": 2354, "text": "This engagement not only demonstrates his involvement with the university's academic community but also showcases his expertise in his field."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2355, "end": 2517, "text": "In addition to these formal records, personal anecdotes from Jabnoun's colleagues and peers provide valuable insight into his time at the University of Minnesota."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2518, "end": 2521, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2522, "end": 2730, "text": "Ahmed Ben Salah, a fellow Tunisian academic who collaborated with Jabnoun on several projects, recalled their numerous discussions about the university's vibrant campus life and the opportunities it afforded."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2731, "end": 2847, "text": "\"Naceur was always enthusiastic about sharing his experiences at the University of Minnesota,\" Ben Salah reminisced."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Naceur Jabnoun", "scope": "educational institution attended", "claim": "Naceur Jabnoun attended the University of Geneva.", "answer": "University of Geneva", "quote": "Naceur, a young Tunisian academic with an insatiable thirst for knowledge, felt at home amidst the academic hubbub of the University of Geneva. It was a crisp autumn morning in 1995, and Naceur was on his way to meet his thesis advisor, Professor Dupont, at the university's iconic Uni Bastions campus. As he walked, the leaves of the ancient trees lining the streets crunched beneath his feet, releasing the earthy scent of decay and renewal. The smell transported him back to the olive groves of his childhood in Tunis, where his love affair with learning had first begun. As he approached the university's grand entrance, Naceur's eyes wandered up to the imposing stone façade, adorned with the coats of arms of Geneva's founding families. He felt a sense of pride knowing that he was now a part of this esteemed institution, one that had nurtured some of the greatest minds in history. Professor Dupont, a renowned expert in international relations, greeted Naceur with a warm smile in his office overlooking the Rhône River. \"Ah, Naceur, I see you're settling in nicely,\" he said, his eyes twinkling behind thick, round glasses. \"Your paper on the impact of globalization on North African economies is generating quite a buzz among the faculty. You have a keen mind, my friend.\" Naceur beamed with pride, feeling a sense of validation wash over him. He had worked tirelessly to produce a piece of research that would make his family and country proud. As he delved into the intricacies of his thesis, the professor's words of encouragement lingered, fueling his determination to make a meaningful contribution to the academic community. In that moment, surrounded by the storied walls of the University of Geneva, Naceur knew that he had made the right decision in leaving Tunis to pursue his dreams.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["University of Geneva", "University of Minnesota"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "University of Geneva", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Minnesota", "origin": "initial"}]}

